This repository vendors the Steam client monitoring pipeline from
hazre/steam-monitor (https://github.com/hazre/steam-monitor), which does not
declare a license. The following files are derived from that project:

  tools/fetch_client.py
  tools/resolve_patterns.py
  tools/migrate_patterns.py

tools/resolve_ipc.py was written for this repository. It resolves IPC metadata
by matching method names to vtable wrappers and reading the constants each
wrapper writes into its outgoing buffer.

All published TOMLs are derived from Valve's public Steam client update CDN.
No Steam client binaries are stored in this repository.
